fixed         | Kamuzu Day                           | 5 14                 | public          |  |  |  |
fixed         | Independence Day                     | 7 6                  | public          |  |  |  |
decree        | Independence Day (observed)          | 2024-7-8 2025-7-7    | public          |  |  |  |
fixed         | Mother's Day                         | 10 15                | public          |  |  |  |
fixed         | Christmas Day                        | 12 25                | public          |  |  |  |
fixed         | Boxing Day                           | 12 26                | public          |  |  |  |
